sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GapPeripheralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapPeripheral]
    Note over App, Node: Standby() is allowed from standby, advertising, or connected.<br>It terminates any advertising or connection, returning the Node to standby.<br>Calling from standby still yields CurrentState(standby).
    App->>Node: GapPeripheral.Standby()
    Node-->>App: GapPeripheralResponse.CurrentState(standby)
